The vertex shader of dEQP-GLES2.functional.shaders.matrix.mul.uniform_mediump_mat4_mat4_vertex as dEQP-GLES2 writes it, rebuilt from modules/gles2/functional/es2fShaderMatrixTests.cpp (VK-GL-CTS 93bca01, NOTICE 5): deqp_shapes/misc_work_registers.vert with lowp changed to mediump on u_in0, u_in1 and res (the case's precision, ShaderMatrixCase::init's getPrecisionName).
